      "content": "those are okay i guess but they feel a bit surface level. like, is there any deeper philosophical or legal reasoning behind it? like what about the idea of collective vs individual responsibility? or why some people think it would actually make social tension worse? i'm looking for more of the serious academic or legal points against it, not just the easy ones.",
